WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.821
Sylhet, twenty twenty-two.

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.861
The flood maps couldn't see under the trees.

3
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.444
Then came NISAR.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.656
Cameras see cloud. Other radar sees only rivers.

5
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:18.032
NISAR finds the water beneath. Twenty-six square kilometres.

6
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.239
And the people living beside it.

7
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:23.769
It maps fire through smoke, and ground that moves.

8
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:26.809
Under the Canopy.
